{"v":4,"desc":"在這個夢幻般的街機賽車遊戲中控制你的氣墊船，基於真實的物理。\n\n*駕駛並爆炸，通過各種太空和城市高速公路。\n*追逐精英車輛，繼續鑽石任務。\n*獲得新的氣墊船，並使用您的鑽石升級其性能。\n*收集武器並使用它們來減慢AI車輛的速度\n*以驚人的速度躲避和編織交通！你的反應是否足夠快？\n*引起鏈條碰撞，看著氣墊船飛走！\n*實驗基於物理的懸停，崩潰和破壞。\n*通過靈巧駕駛氣墊船賺取巨額獎勵！","publisher":"Pix Arts","release":"2022-07-21","genres":["街機","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69cd5ca9f237d1985d95d82b46c254141aef8c0d89134b3e74c83277a6d224cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/748eac86b7a67477101c755f6350e051727efb6b702355b99fb4187f6229bb7e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8c3c37f59fcdac3cdac06bf25131ee936c160791dceb7052697220c2e780a363.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9fb22f77bd47ed2eab18f3feca992dece35be072a778c1752b9086e3283b9ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8d0ee8f9604eca98d587ecb06ecc07e9375ababfa2823e8474f5368514b0dc2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a56e8b85d66a9eb9b0610d0dbc87c5038210b3861be0b0dbfdc419955936ac7d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bc30188b2000","dlc":[]}